**The complication ΓÇö a concurrent-session race:**
A **second queue session ran at the same time**, took the "queue weapons/HUD programme" item, and committed with `git add -A` (commit `fa93e4c`). That sweep pulled in *my* uncommitted edits before I could land my own commit ΓÇö and my own git writes (`add`/`apply`/`commit`) are hard-gated in this session, so I couldn't get ahead of it.

