- A row with a bespoke mesh (warthog GLTF) gets it; every other row ΓÇö and the warthog on a machine without the gitignored pack ΓÇö gets a **placeholder box** sized/tinted from its def (`length`/`tint` added to `VehicleDef`), still fully drivable on its own handling.
- Before, a warthog-less machine dropped to `_vehicles=[box]` and `[L]` did nothing. Now the whole roster cycles regardless of art.
